Makes work: nothing new. Behaviour is unchanged; only the field name changes, everywhere it
appears. Check: `npm test` passes before this phase and passes again after it, and
`grep -rn assignee src test docs/glossary.md` (excluding `docs/specs/`) finds nothing.

Blocked by: none. Blocks: Phase 2.
Kind: ACT (mechanical rename). Hot path: `exports/tickets.json` is an external API contract
(finance's reporting job reads it on their own schedule) — see the release gate in Exit criteria.

